## Language Review

**Verdict:** Needs revision

### Findings
- [MODERATE] Headings contain non-text symbols — `{{< ai4sc-icon workflow >}}` on lines 43, 161, 164, 331, 450, 569 — and `≡` on line 73. Per criteria, headings should contain words instead of symbols. → Remove icon/emoji syntax from headings; use plain text titles.

- [MODERATE] Missing Midjourney/image credits on book title band image (line 19, `mj_title_band.jpg`), senior engineer image (line 520, `.midjourney` class with no `credit=` or `%%credit` attribute), and `partA_3.svg` (line 31). → Add `Midjourney: <description>` credits to each image.

- [MODERATE] Slide "Ablauf" (line 29) and "Quiz" (line 602): Navigation labels, not claims. → Replace "Ablauf" with a claim such as "Agile Arbeitsweise als Grundprinzip dieses Kurses". (Quiz may be acceptable as an appendix section title exception.)

- [MODERATE] Repeated use of gendered noun forms: `Ingenieur` (line 55), `Ingenieursrolle` (line 529), `Ingenieursverantwortung` (line 500), `Senior-Entwickler` (line 503), `Junior-Entwickler` (line 508). → Replace with gender-inclusive forms: `Ingenieurin und Ingenieur`, `Senior-Entwicklerin und Senior-Entwickler`, etc.

- [MINOR] Book line 157: "denselben Review-Prozess" — the text has "dieselben" which is feminine; `Prozess` is masculine, requiring "denselben". → `denselben Review-Prozess`.

- [MINOR] Slide line 285: "Agentisches Werkzeug" — inconsistent capitalization; `agentisch` elsewhere is lowercase. → Lowercase to `agentisches Werkzeug`.

- [MINOR] Slide line 140: Bullet "Schnell Entwürfe liefern" breaks parallelism with the other verb+noun bullets in the group. → `[Entwürfe schnell liefern]{.pro}` for parallel construction.

- [MINOR] Book line 92: Long sentence (47 words) with two em-dash structures that break parallel flow. → Consider splitting or using a semicolon for clarity.

- [MINOR] Book line 55: Vague quantifier "Milliarden von Texten" — acceptable in context but could cite source. → Consider "mehreren hundert Milliarden" or add a footnote.

